{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18106200","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18106200","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1810620001:0":{"text":"终于……终于要为苔佩希小姐举行继任仪式了！","source_cn":"终于……终于要为苔佩希小姐举行继任仪式了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD450392B2C1449","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810620002:0":{"text":"不，不对。现在该称苔佩希阁下了。","source_cn":"不，不对。现在该称苔佩希阁下了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39F4FEE9908E3C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810620003:0":{"text":"你为什么这么兴奋？对于你我这样的仆人而言，无论她是否继任都没有区别，她都是这里的主人。","source_cn":"你为什么这么兴奋？对于你我这样的仆人而言，无论她是否继...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5DD728B7C6F3BCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810620004:1":{"text":"可是继任仪式之后有舞会啊，盛大的舞会！城堡里几十年，甚至上百年才会热闹这么一次！","source_cn":"可是继任仪式之后有舞会啊，盛大的舞会！城堡里几十年，甚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4467FCA5047F5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810620005:1":{"text":"刚好这次舞会没有安排我去服侍，也许我也该找个角落享受一下舞会的氛围……有没有什么比较合适的地方呢……","source_cn":"刚好这次舞会没有安排我去服侍，也许我也该找个角落享受一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CC4E79585ED197E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_ma